WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:08.180
The quickest way to check your child in or out is from your own phone, with the Check in button in the middle of the bottom bar.

2
00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:17.560
Tap it, then point your camera at the check-in QR poster by the door. You'll see a green screen listing each child you signed in.

3
00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:23.200
If you have more than one child, they're all signed in together with one scan.

4
00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:29.730
Your child's status updates straight away, and the check-in time appears at the top of their day.

5
00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:38.780
If your hands are full, an educator can check your child in for you instead. Either way, you get a notification with the time.
